sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Sign-in and account connection
    accDescr: Firebase restores or creates the session, the app bootstraps a FootyLevels profile, and every API call carries an ID token with one refresh on 401.
    autonumber
    actor P as Player
    participant App as iOS app
    participant FA as Firebase Auth
    participant API as FootyLevels API
    participant FS as Firestore
    App->>FA: Restore saved session from the Keychain
    alt No session
        App->>P: Splash, then sign-in sheet
        P->>App: Email and password, or Google
        App->>FA: Sign in or create the account
    end
    FA-->>App: Signed-in user
    App->>FA: getIDToken
    App->>API: POST /api/me/bootstrap with Bearer token
    API->>FA: Verify signature, audience, expiry, revoked or disabled
    API->>FS: Create the profile once, UID and name from the token
    API-->>App: Profile, accountState active
    App->>App: Show the tabs
    App->>API: Any protected request
    alt 401 expired token
        App->>FA: getIDToken forcing refresh
        App->>API: Retry once
        opt Second 401
            App->>FA: Sign out
        end
    end
